iphone" target="_blank" class="cursor-pointer pl-2 text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-blue-500 hover:underline">Xem chi tiết</a></p></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="mt-0.5 flex size-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(233.74deg, rgb(239, 245, 255) -33.75%, rgb(59, 130, 246) 71.83%);">3</div><p class="flex-1 text-base text-neutral-800"><span>trả góp 0% lãi suất, tối đa 12 tháng, trả trước từ 10% qua CTTC hoặc 0đ qua thẻ tín dụng</span><a href="https://cellphones.com.vn/huong-dan-mua-hang-tra-gop-bang-the-tin-dung-tai-cellphones" target="_blank" class="cursor-pointer pl-2 text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-blue-500 hover:underline">Xem chi tiết</a></p></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="mt-0.5 flex size-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(233.74deg, rgb(239, 245, 255) -33.75%, rgb(59, 130, 246) 71.83%);">4</div><p class="flex-1 text-base text-neutral-800"><span>Chi thêm 10K - nhận Sim/Esim 5G VNSKY, có ngay 3GB data/ngày+500 phút gọi Mobifone &amp; VNSKY, miễn phí 30 ngày đầu - chỉ áp dụng tại cửa hàng</span></p></li></ol></div></div></div></div><div class="my-4 empty:hidden"><div class="swiper swiper-banner-special-promotion swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal w-full swiper-backface-hidden"><div class="swiper-wrapper" style="transition-duration: 300ms; transform: translate3d(-596px, 0px, 0px);"><div class="swiper-slide swiper-slide-next swiper-slide-prev h-auto! w-full!" data-swiper-slide-index="1" style="width: 592px; margin-right: 4px;"><div class="flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="cps-image-cdn relative inline-block h-auto w-full object-cover cursor-default"><img alt="Banner Trả góp" loading="lazy" width="640" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100 object-contain h-auto w-full object-cover cursor-