r\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Hiện tại, các dòng chơi game mượt nhất thường là các máy thuộc dòng \u003cstrong\u003egaming phone hoặc các flagship có cấu hình mạnh\u003c/strong\u003e. Nổi bật gồm có: \u003cstrong\u003eAsus ROG Phone. Nubia Red Magic, Samsung S series và iPhone Pro Max,... \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"6a:[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Product\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Điện thoại\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://cdn2.cellphones.com.vn/x/media/favicon/default/logo-cps.png\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Mua online điện thoại giá rẻ T11/2026, smartphone chính hãng, điện thoại thông minh, trả góp 0%, BH 24 tháng. Mua dtdd tại CellphoneS ngay\\\",\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"AggregateOffer\\\",\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"VND\\\",\\\"highPrice\\\":\\\"103990000\\\",\\\"lowPrice\\\":\\\"470000\\\"},\\\"additionalProperty\\\":[]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$75\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"item\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://cellphones.com.vn/\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"CELLPHONES\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"item\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://cellphones.com.vn/mobile.html\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Điện thoại\\\"}}]}\"}}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"76:I[85854,[\"4506\",\"static/chunks/f97e080b-dd43c514b0257366.js\",\"5897\",\"static/chunks/f8025e75-a0f897cc474a72f1.js\",\"5479\",\"static/chunks/795d4814-5b66d0c8dcb1c98c.js\",\"8087\",\"static/chunks/0e762574-1344983f675ed995.js\",\"2150\",\"static/chunks/59650de3-40